/**
 * Configuration interface for a table column definition.
 *
 *  * [👤compose📚js🗃️sketchpad💻elements🔖windowcomponents🔖table🛠️tablecolumn](composerepo://p/u/compose/b/l/js/fd/org/sketchpad/f/elements.tsx/s/Window%20Components/s/Table/d/i/TableColumn)
