// [👤compose📚js🗃️sketchpad💻portcolor🔖portcolor🪨normalizeguid](composerepo://p/u/compose/b/l/js/fd/org/sketchpad/f/portColor.ts/s/Port%20Color/d/i/normalizeGuid)
