// [👤compose📚js🗃️sketchpad💻portcolor🔖portcolor🪨createportgroupmap](composerepo://p/u/compose/b/l/js/fd/org/sketchpad/f/portColor.ts/s/Port%20Color/d/i/createPortGroupMap)
 * createPortGroupMap holds the data fields for a createPortGroupMap record.
